# Allow-list build context: ignore everything, then admit only what the
# image needs. Keeps venv/, .venv/, .git/, .zen/, .dvc/, tests/, notebooks/,
# data/, models/, mlruns/, mlflow.db, reports/ and caches out of the context.
*

!requirements-serve.txt
!src/

# Never ship bytecode or editor/OS clutter even from inside src/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
